('B2', '“Therefore, there is now no condemnation for those who are in Christ Jesus.” (Romans 8:1). For false guilt and shame.'),
('B2', '“If we confess our sins, He is faithful and just to forgive us our sins and to cleanse us from all unrighteousness.” (1 John 1:9). For true moral injury.'),
('B', '**Faith community (clinical).** Lack of social support predicts PTSD (Brewin et al., 2000). With consent, help the client reconnect with a supportive church, and invite a pastor or chaplain to help address moral injury.'),
('B', '**Ministers:** offer presence and practical support; avoid pressing for detailed retelling or forced debriefing, and refer persistent symptoms beyond a month to a trained trauma therapist (Rose et al., 2002).'),
